# Store text as LF in git. Linux scripts, the Dockerfile and the Caddyfile
# must keep LF even when checked out on Windows (a CR breaks "#!/bin/sh"
# and Caddy's parser); Windows batch files keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.docx binary
*.db binary
